cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AI Strategic Autonomy Framework: Assessment Framework"
abstract: >-
  A framework for measuring AI strategic autonomy: whether an organisation or a state
  can keep its critical AI systems running, and keep improving them, if a supplier or a
  government withdraws access. Nine weighted pillars for companies, eight for states,
  scored against written anchors; every sub-indicator tagged resilience or autonomy;
  published with an Evidence Base of dated 2024-2026 incidents and primary sources.
type: dataset
authors:
